          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "The giving of presents is far more common in the East, and has more significance, than with us. Hardly any transaction of importance can take place without a gift. The formal visits which friends make to each other are preceded by presents of fowls, sheep, rice, coffee, and other…"
      },
      "c-c28231c70686e36d": {
